sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Native UI
  participant L as SQLite owner
  participant S as Server
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>L: Save draft/pending operation
  L-->>U: Locally saved, not server accepted
  L->>S: Send mutation with stable operation ID
  S->>D: Authorize + mutate + idempotency + outbox transaction
  D-->>S: Committed authoritative revision
  S-->>L: Scoped resumable event
  L->>L: Atomically apply row + FTS effects + cursor
  L-->>U: Server accepted
  Note over L,S: Revocation triggers purge/resnapshot; filtered streams define their own cursor semantics
